~ start
The roar of the water softens. Somewhere above the rooftops, a light sweeps through the rain.

Ollie: ...A light.

Ollie: Is that a boat?

The beam drifts across the flooded street. It passes right over the roof without stopping.

Ollie: Wait. Wait!

Ollie: Over here! We’re here!

Rescuer (distant): ...Hello? Anyone out there?

Ollie: Here! Please, look this way!

The light turns away. The engine hum starts to fade.

Ollie: No. No, no, no. They can’t leave.

Ollie: I have to make them see me. Now.

=> END